# Keep ordinary Rust and Python tests in production scans. A repository-owned
# file replaces Semgrep's built-in exclusions for test/, tests/, and testsuite/.
# Git-ignored environments, caches, and build outputs remain excluded by Git.
.git/
node_modules/
vendor/

# Deliberately invalid rule fixtures are checked separately by just semgrep-test.
/tests/semgrep/
